           </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-8 border-b border-gray-100\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n                <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 text-center\">Looking for other brand divisions?</p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 opacity-70\">\n                    <a href=\"/croma-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Croma Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/daikin-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Daikin Support</a>\n                    <a href=\"/godrej-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Godrej Services</a>\n                    <a href=\"/haier-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Haier Experts</a>\n                    <a href=\"/hi-sense-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Hisense Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/kelvinator-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara/\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-200\">Kelvinator Support</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"about\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm: